<title>USA: Olsten Corp to defend itself from lawsuit.</title>
<headline>Olsten Corp to defend itself from lawsuit.</headline>
<dateline>MELVILLE, N.Y. 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Olsten Corp said on Thursday it has not yet seen a shareholder lawsuit that was filed against the company, but it will defend its position &quot;vigorously.&quot;</p>
<p>Two law firms said earlier that they filed a lawsuit on behalf of shareholders who bought the stock in connection with a merger with Quantum Health Resources.</p>
<p>&quot;While we have not received the complaint, management believes that it has acted responsibly in communicating with shareholders. We intend to defend our position vigorously,&quot; the company said in a statement.</p>
</text>
